      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Relocating an office in Dumka involves more than just moving furniture and equipment; it requires strict adherence to statutory compliance to avoid penalties and ensure smooth business continuity. Below are the three critical compliance components that any corporate client should secure when engaging an Office Relocation Service provider.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Itemized GST Tax Invoices</strong>
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>All invoices must be generated under the Goods and Services Tax (GST) regime, clearly indicating the supplier’s GSTIN, the recipient’s GSTIN, and the place of supply (Dumka, Jharkhand).</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Invoices should be itemized, separating each service (e.g., packing, loading, transportation, unpacking, and installation) with its respective HSN code and taxable value.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The tax rate (typically 18% for relocation services) must be shown separately as CGST and SGST, or IGST if the service is inter‑state.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Each invoice must contain the invoice number, date of issue, and a digital signature or QR code for e‑verification, complying with the GST e‑invoicing mandate for businesses with turnover above the prescribed threshold.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </span></li>

  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>IBA‑Approved Certificates for Corporate Tax Audits</strong>
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The Institute of Business Auditors (IBA) certifies that the relocation expenses are genuine, reasonable, and directly attributable to business operations.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Certificates must detail the scope of work, the cost breakdown, and a declaration of compliance with the Income Tax Act, Section 37(1) (allowable business expenses).</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>These documents are essential during corporate tax audits, providing auditors with verifiable proof that the relocation costs are deductible.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Ensure the certificate is signed by an IBA‑registered auditor and includes the auditor’s registration number, stamp, and date of issuance.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </span></li>

  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Comprehensive Transit Insurance</strong>
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Transit insurance should cover loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural calamities for all movable assets during the relocation period.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The policy must list the insured value of each asset, the insured risk period (from packing at the origin to installation at the destination), and the insurer’s registration under the Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (IRDAI).</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Claims procedures, deductibles, and exclusions must be clearly outlined to avoid disputes post‑relocation.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Retain the insurance certificate and the policy schedule as part of the statutory documentation for future audits and legal compliance.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </span></li>
</ul>

<p>By securing itemized GST invoices, IBA‑approved audit certificates, and comprehensive transit insurance, corporations relocating in Dumka can meet statutory requirements, safeguard assets, and ensure that relocation expenses are fully deductible under Indian tax law.</p></div>
